NOTE ON ART ASSETS / 美术资源说明

The MIT license above covers the source code in this repository
(lib/, companion/, tools/, test/).

It does NOT cover the artwork under assets/ (sprite frames, GIFs, portraits,
platform and background images). Those assets are fan-made derivations of
characters from the game "奥奇传说" (Aola Legend, 百田信息科技 / Taomee-Baidu
family of products). Their copyright belongs to the rights holder.

The assets are included for personal, non-commercial, educational use with
this plugin only. Do not redistribute them commercially. If you are the rights
holder and want them removed, please open an issue.
